{title: Son of Bani}
{subtitle: 1 Chronicles 9:4; Nehemiah 3:2; 1 Chronicles 9:3–4}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 79}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Eb] | [Gm7] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]Uthai son of Ammihud stands [Eb]tall
[Gm7]Son of Omri in the ancient [Eb]hall
[Bb]From the line of Imri he [Eb]came
[Cm7]Son of Ba[Bb/D]ni bearing the [Eb]name
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Roots in [Bb]Judah deep and [Eb]true
Part of [Gm7]Perez family [Eb]tree
In Je[Bb]rusalem they lived with [Eb]care
From the days of old to [Bb]now [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Next to Jericho the men [Eb]built
[Gm7]Zaccur son of Imri [Eb]stood
[Bb]He raised the wall with steady [Eb]hands
[Cm7]Restoring [Bb/D]what the exile [Eb]planned
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Cm7]Descendants of Perez son of Ju[Eb]dah
[Bb]Living in the city’s [F]heart
[Cm7]Together with Benjamin and Ep[Eb]hraim
[Bb]Rebuilding the broken [F]wall
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Roots in [Bb]Judah deep and [Eb]true
Part of [Gm]Perez family [Eb]tree
In Je[Bb]rusalem they lived with [Eb]care
From the days of old to [Bb]now [Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Cm7]Son of Bani name re[Eb]membered
[Cm7]In the genealogy’s [Eb]song
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Outro (instrumental)}
